subckt dut (VDD VSS Vin1 Vin2 Vout1 Vout2)
I1 (net0 VSS) isource dc=1m
I2 (net1 VSS) isource dc=1m
I3 (VDD X) isource dc=1m
I4 (VDD Y) isource dc=1m
M1 (X Vin1 net0 VSS) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
M2 (Y Vin2 net1 VSS) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
M3 (net0 X VDD VDD) sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
M4 (net1 Y VDD VDD) sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
M5 (Vout1 Y VDD VDD) sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
M6 (Vout2 X VDD VDD) sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
RD1 (Vout1 VSS) resistor r=1k
RD2 (Vout2 VSS) resistor r=1k
RS (net1 net0) resistor r=1k
